TECHNOLOGY CHOICES
-----------------
Rendering: Client Component ('use client' directive)
  - Reason: Settings require user interaction and state management
  - All child components use Zustand stores and React hooks

Layout Strategy: Responsive with breakpoint-specific layouts
  - Mobile (< lg): Accordion sections
  - Desktop (>= lg): Expanded card sections
  - Breakpoint: Tailwind's 'lg' (1024px)

Navigation: useRouter from next/navigation
  - Back button navigates to "/" (dashboard)
  - Programmatic navigation with router.push()

Styling: Tailwind CSS with shadcn/ui components
  - Gradient background (blue-50 to white)
  - Dark mode support (dark: variants)
  - Consistent spacing with Tailwind utilities

State Management: Zustand (via child components)
  - Settings components manage their own store slices
  - Page only composes, doesn't manage state

SEO Strategy: Metadata in layout.tsx
  - Title includes app name for brand consistency
  - Description optimized for search engines
  - Keywords relevant to settings functionality

